ns going through this together.] The increase in sales of home safes noted. The government\u2019s plan to take ownership stakes in banks and the G-7 response discussed. ", "segment_duration": 200, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63060.0", "legacy_segment_id": 920944, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "v8x7sohDmE", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 920943, "segment_id": "XqCEIdoulo", "segment_broadcast_id": "v8x7sohDmE", "segment_title": "Financial Notebook (World Markets)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Maggie Rodriguez) Reports introduced.  \n\n(London: Richard Roth) The market mayhem in Europe featured; the drop in stocks in London, France and Germany cited.  \n\n(Tokyo: Barry Petersen) The economic crisis in Asia featured; statistics for Hong Kong, Australia and Tokyo and the drop in Toyota sales cited. ", "segment_duration": 80, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63260.0", "legacy_segment_id": 920945, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "v8x7sohDmE", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 920943, "segment_id": "Da4YBjdbTz", "segment_broadcast_id": "v8x7sohDmE", "segment_title": "Economy: Credit Crisis", "segment_description": "(Stu